      "imagePrompt": "Use the approved L058 style anchors: modern children's picture-book illustration, warm natural light, fine pencil-and-watercolor linework, detailed but clean environments, consistent expressive preschool proportions, soft cheeks, gentle facial expressions, bright warm palette, phone-readable composition. 一個人在洗澡或準備洗澡，水龍頭溫度控制不好：冷水出來太冷，熱水出來又太熱。這是常見浴室情境。畫面需兒童安全、不得裸露；可用浴缸泡泡、浴巾、背影或遮擋方式呈現。不要在圖片中放任何文字、符號、數字或標籤。 No visible text, numbers, letters, zhuyin, labels, logos, signs, icons, captions, or watermark anywhere.",
